      "duration": 13.7,
      "score": 7.74,
      "text": "The culture that doesn't fit our own personal values, that's bad. But in practice, nobody is right. Realize your own bias. How do your values affect the way you judge other people? How can you learn about other people's values and judge them according to their values instead of your own? There is no right culture, no wrong culture. Oh, by the way, this isn't just an internet design thing. The practice of packing dense information into small spaces can be widely found in advertising.",
